%% Role revocation and cache invalidation (SPEC 4.2, LLD-iam §3, IAM-2 to IAM-4)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Security admin
    participant API as Authorization service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as Grant cache
    participant Product as Product service

    Admin->>API: DELETE /v1/users/{userId}/roles/{role}
    alt user does not exist (IAM-3)
        API-->>Admin: 404 not_found
    else user exists
        API->>DB: delete role assignment and insert audit record (one transaction, IAM-4)
        DB-->>API: committed
        API->>Cache: delete grants for userId (IAM-2)
        API-->>Admin: 204 No Content
    end

    Product->>API: GET /v1/authorize?userId&action
    API->>Cache: read grants for userId
    Cache-->>API: miss
    API->>DB: read current roles
    DB-->>API: roles without the revoked role
    API->>Cache: store grants (TTL 30 s)
    API-->>Product: allowed = false (IAM-1)
